  "reviewNotes": "PDFpage10/nativefull/front-back/+X/ware/lattice inspected. Source519966tri/25998384bytes/SHA913200aab1b863094cee473111bd6f52cfd32a0deac0fefaf2d2eb42f67dc187/maxZ75.078400. FloorX withYedge rails, rearY planks/uprightZ posts, cabinetZ panels/Y cornices and rails. Source diagonal lattices have slopesY/Z ±.95/.955 and protrudeX≈-5.5 versus opaque recessed backingX≈-5.95; gold backing as PDF, no synthetic glass. Four separately bounded brass knobs, eight vertical iron hinge barrels, each cylinder fitted independently to native ray cross-sections(radius.2696..2714mm,residual≤.00244mm). Three gray-olive bowls, uprightochre mug and fallen terracotta mug; both empty. Upright probe[-4.3,-.5]hits46.54964 below51.6rim, fallen+Xprobe[-.2,7.6,47.4]hitsX-4.44860. Preserve sculpted depths/handles. DecorXmax2.03925 fits conservative western blockerX≤2.4,Y±17.65. NativefrontquarterpointsX8.75,Y±8.75 hit25.70559/25.69637,nZ>.999; midline atY0 has loweredgroove24.6989, omitunnecessarybadstandpoint. No light/emission inherited. Validate both independently simplifiedtiers, source geometry/holes, actualpackedcolour/ORM/hardware/woodcontacts, source/packedfootprint, compactcomparison andfreshMCP."
